 "foot": {
  "text": "Launch at t0; o_req after two destination edges; o_ack after two source edges; the cycle closes 12 source cycles after launch. Payload D0 is held from launch until o_req falls. reg_req and reg_ack are the two source flags; no FSM state exists."
